TODO for vpinball Debian packaging
===================================

To be completed before first official package build:

1. Generate correct MD5 checksums
   - Run: md5sum debian/*.install > debian/*.md5sums
   - Or use: dh_md5sums during build

2. Test package build
   - Run: dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc
   - Verify all files are included

3. Validate desktop files
   - Run: desktop-file-validate apps/linux/*.desktop

4. Test installation
   - Run: dpkg -i ../vpinball_*.deb
   - Verify application launches

5. Update version in changelog
   - Use: dch -l~b1731
   - Or edit debian/changelog directly

6. Sign package (optional for official release)
   - Run: debsign ../vpinball_*.changes
   - Requires GPG key setup

Additional improvements for future versions:

- Create vpinball-tables metapackage for community tables
- Create vpinball-docs metapackage for documentation
- Add AppImage support for easy distribution
- Add Flatpak manifest for Flathub
- Add Snapcraft.yaml for Snap Store
- Create Docker image for containerized setup

Package naming convention:
- Binary: vpinball
- Common: vpinball-common
- Debug: vpinball-dbg

Architecture support:
- amd64 (Debian stable)
- arm64 (Debian stable)
- i386 (optional)